[I] Implementation of a "Singleton" class

[T] Class::Singleton is a base class implementing the Singleton pattern, so
[T] that only one instance of a derived class exists and is returned by
[T] every call to its instance() constructor.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Class-Singleton

